# DRIFTLINE: proof the game can be completed. From the title, the demo
# player starts a 1-player run and drives all four stages, bosses and
# bonus stages included, pressing the buttons for real (no cheats), to the
# ending; then the credits and the title. The Saucer is earned and the
# win is saved.
game driftline
botuntil state == 6 70000
expect won == 1
expect stage == 4
expect goals & 2
print score
print deaths
print coins
print frame
expect bonus_played >= 1
botuntil state == 0 4000
expect save_wins == 1
expect save_runs == 1
expect save_best > 0
